# Status

Living dashboard — the first thing every session reads and the last thing it
updates. Keep it terse: this file answers "what is true right now," not "what
happened" (that's `harness/*/history.md`). Harness rule 3 makes updating it
mandatory for whoever starts/finishes a job OR picks up/hands off a
directive; rule 8 caps its length, so compact old entries out rather than
letting it grow.

